flowchart TD

    %% =====================================
    %% CUSTOMER ENTRY
    %% =====================================

    Customer[👤 Customer]

    Customer --> GuestCart
    Customer --> Login

    %% =====================================
    %% GUEST CART FLOW
    %% =====================================

    GuestCart[Guest Cart]

    GuestCart --> LocalStorage
    GuestCart --> AddItem

    LocalStorage[Browser Storage]
    AddItem[Add Product To Cart]

    %% =====================================
    %% AUTHENTICATED FLOW
    %% =====================================

    Login[User Login]

    Login --> UserCart

    UserCart[Authenticated Cart]

    %% =====================================
    %% CART MERGE FLOW
    %% =====================================

    GuestCart --> CartMerge

    UserCart --> CartMerge

    CartMerge[Cart Merge Engine]

    CartMerge --> MergeRules

    MergeRules[Merge Products & Quantities]

    MergeRules --> UnifiedCart

    UnifiedCart[Unified User Cart]

    %% =====================================
    %% CART STORAGE
    %% =====================================

    UnifiedCart --> CartAPI

    CartAPI[Cart API]

    CartAPI --> Redis

    CartAPI --> MySQL

    Redis[(Redis Cart Cache)]
    MySQL[(MySQL)]

    %% =====================================
    %% MULTI DEVICE SYNC
    %% =====================================

    UnifiedCart --> Device1
    UnifiedCart --> Device2
    UnifiedCart --> Device3

    Device1[📱 Mobile]
    Device2[💻 Desktop]
    Device3[📱 Tablet]

    Device1 --> CartAPI
    Device2 --> CartAPI
    Device3 --> CartAPI

    %% =====================================
    %% REAL TIME SYNCHRONIZATION
    %% =====================================

    CartAPI --> CartEvents

    CartEvents[Cart Update Events]

    CartEvents --> SyncEngine

    SyncEngine[Synchronization Engine]

    SyncEngine --> Device1
    SyncEngine --> Device2
    SyncEngine --> Device3

    %% =====================================
    %% INVENTORY VALIDATION
    %% =====================================

    UnifiedCart --> InventoryCheck

    InventoryCheck[Inventory Validation]

    InventoryCheck --> InStock
    InventoryCheck --> OutOfStock

    InStock[Available]
    OutOfStock[Unavailable]

    %% =====================================
    %% PRICE VALIDATION
    %% =====================================

    UnifiedCart --> PriceCheck

    PriceCheck[Price Validation]

    PriceCheck --> CurrentPrice

    CurrentPrice[Latest Product Pricing]

    %% =====================================
    %% CART RECOVERY
    %% =====================================

    MySQL --> RecoveryEngine

    RecoveryEngine[Cart Recovery]

    RecoveryEngine --> ReturningUser

    ReturningUser[Returning Customer]

    %% =====================================
    %% CHECKOUT HANDOFF
    %% =====================================

    UnifiedCart --> CheckoutValidation

    CheckoutValidation[Final Cart Validation]

    CheckoutValidation --> Checkout

    Checkout[Checkout Process]

    %% =====================================
    %% ABANDONED CART FLOW
    %% =====================================

    UnifiedCart --> AbandonedCart

    AbandonedCart[Abandoned Cart]

    AbandonedCart --> RetentionEngine

    RetentionEngine[Recovery Campaign]

    RetentionEngine --> EmailReminder

    EmailReminder[Email / Notification]

    %% =====================================
    %% MONITORING
    %% =====================================

    CartAPI --> Metrics

    Metrics[Cart Metrics]

    Metrics --> Dashboard

    Dashboard[Operational Dashboard]